$\Rightarrow$ from $P$ to $Q$ $\Rightarrow$ \textbf{D}.}

\subsection{Floating charged droplet}
Weight balanced by electric force:
\[
qE = mg \quad\Rightarrow\quad E = \frac{mg}{q},\quad q = \frac{mgd}{V}.
\]
For a \textbf{positive} drop to float, $\vec E$ (and $q\vec E$) must be upward.

