Neglect gravity unless the question is a floating-drop problem.
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=1.4em]
  \item $\vec a = q\vec E/m$ (constant).
  \item $\vec v_0$ perpendicular to $\vec E$ $\Rightarrow$ \textbf{parabolic} path
        (like projectile motion).
  \item Energy: $\tfrac12 mv^{2}$ changes by $|q\,\Delta V|$.
\end{itemize}

