        to[R, l_={$R_2$}, a^={$V_2=3\,\mathrm{V}$}] (3.4,0)
        -- (0,0);
\end{circuitikz}
\end{center}
$6\,\mathrm{C}$ of charge pass once around the loop.
\begin{enumerate}
  \item How much energy does the battery supply?
  \item How much energy is converted in $R_1$ and in $R_2$?
\end{enumerate}
