&
Energy \emph{converted / spent} per coulomb \emph{across a load}
\\[0.35em]
Chemical $\to$ electrical (in a cell)
&
Electrical $\to$ heat, light, \ldots
\\[0.35em]
Symbol $\mathcal{E}$; the ``$1.5\,\mathrm{V}$'' on a cell
&
Symbol $V$; what a voltmeter reads
\\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

\ex
